    <!-- Clear confirmation (§5.4, #49). -->
    <string name="clear_title">Clear trouble codes?</string>
    <string name="clear_body">Manual DTC clearance is not recommended.\n\nClearing turns off the check-engine lamp and resets the emission readiness monitors, so the car may not pass an inspection until it has been driven for a while. Switch the engine off and leave the ignition on first. Permanent codes stay until the car confirms the repair.\n\nSure to continue?</string>
